              <h3>Development</h3>
            </div>
            <p>When enterprise eCommerce platforms fail under pressure, it directly impacts the revenue. We prevent that.</p>
            <p>We set up integrations through structured APIs and governed data flows. Our experts architect database schemas for scale, configure infrastructure, and optimize indexing and caching around projected concurrency and peak events. This process gives you a platform that handles the real-world pressure even as you plan to expand.</p>
