              <h3>Consulting</h3>
            </div>
            <p>Your enterprise eCommerce decisions will shape the cost structure for years. Our eCommerce consulting services help you gain clarity before you commit.</p><p>We study your business layer by layer, understanding infrastructure settings, integrations, user base, market challenges, and scaling thresholds. We quantify risk and then define a clear direction: Re-architect, replatform, or optimize. This gives your project cost visibility, technical certainty, and long-term scalability. You move forward confidently</p>
