            <h3>Headless Commerce</h3>
          </div>
          <p>If your frontend team needs speed but the backend doesn’t allow change, it is time to get headless commerce in action. We help you set your presentation apart from commerce logic and link everything using APIs. This gives your teams the freedom to experiment without putting order flow or integrations at stake. With our services, you can also redesign, localize, or launch new channels without interrupting the transaction engine.</p>
