            <h3>Digital Transformation for Retail</h3>
          </div>
          <p>In retail systems, POS is here and eCommerce there. We consolidate them into one strong ecosystem where data flows non-stop across touchpoints. This organizes your operations like never before. When a sale happens, inventory updates automatically across all locations. Orders sync with fulfillment. And reporting gives leadership accurate, real-time updates without manual intervention.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
