            <h3>Inventory Management System</h3>
          </div>
          <p>Inventory challenges often surface during growth. Disconnected stock data leads to overselling, stockouts, and delayed fulfillment. We deploy inventory management systems that synchronize stock levels across eCommerce channels, physical stores, and warehouses through real-time updates. Automated replenishment logic and threshold alerts prevent disruption, giving your teams accurate visibility and protecting margin during peak demand cycles.</p>
        </div>
