                            <div id="collapseTwo" class="collapse collap-card" aria-labelledby="faqtitleTwo" data-parent="#homefaq">
                                <div class="card-body">It depends on what you are planning to build. If you want to launch a basic store (theme, basic integration, and setup) using a platform like Shopify, the budget should be between $1,000 and $5,000. Custom eCommerce solutions and advanced platforms cost more than $15,000.</div>
