                            <div id="collapsethree" class="collapse collap-card" aria-labelledby="faqtitlethree" data-parent="#homefaq">
                                <div class="card-body">Every eCommerce platform is best in a way, depending on what you’re looking for. While Adobe Commerce is ideal for complex customization, Shopify Plus helps with rapid international rollout. The right platform depends on architecture, integrations, and expansion goals.</div>
