                                    How does Headless Commerce benefit an enterprise-level business?
                                </button></div>
                            <div id="collapsefour" class="collapse collap-card" aria-labelledby="faqtitlefour" data-parent="#homefaq">
                                <div class="card-body">Headless commerce simplifies workflows by separating frontend experience from backend operations. This enterprise level eCommerce solution speeds up UI changes, omnichannel deployment, and experimentation without interrupting core processes.</div>
